OL,3,GNEWSACorby metal pollution may harm
OL,4,Apeople, says study
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners trying to examine the
OL,7,Feffects of the toxic waste scandal in
OL,8,FCorby say they have found a presence of
OL,9,Fmetals which could post a risk to human
OL,10,Fhealth.
OL,12,FChildren in the Northamptonshire town
OL,13,Fhave been born with birth defects,
OL,14,Fbelieved to have been caused when
OL,15,Fsteelworks were demolished in the
OL,16,F1980s.
OL,18,FCharity Earthwatch Europe says trained
OL,19,Fcitizen scientists have found
OL,20,Fpotentially harmful levels of metal or
OL,21,Fmetalloid at 52 freshwater sites across
OL,22,FCorby.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,367,360,200,160,0,100
