OL,3,GNEWSACorby metal pollution may harm
OL,4,Apeople, says study
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency (EA) welcomed
OL,7,Ftheir work but said some metals
OL,8,Foccurred naturally and that its own
OL,9,Fevidence did not indicate "widespread
OL,10,For significant harm".
